### The tooling's work folders: transpiled C++, objects, the bootstrap executable
### (build.js, tools/bootstrap.js) ###
/build/

### The `_simse` cache: a project's extended compiler and the sources staged for it
### (specs/simse-md.md) - written beside a project's root, never inside it ###
_simse/

### Visual Studio: the profiling project's output (simse.vcxproj/simse.slnx) and the
### per-user state the IDE writes beside it ###
/profile/
.vs/
*.user

### Stress harness work directories (tools/stress.js) ###
/stress/.work/

### Documentation examples: the sources live under examples/*/src, the
### amalgamation and the executable are generated by the commands in
### docs/getting-started.md ###
/examples/**/*.cpp
/examples/**/*.exe
/examples/**/*.pdb
/examples/**/*.ilk
### The SDL2 example copies the DLL it binds at run time (examples/sdl2/run.bat) ###
/examples/sdl2/app/SDL2.dll
### The HTTP example's server log (examples/http) ###
/examples/http/**/*.log

### 1BRC benchmark: generated data and the C++ baseline build ###
/benchmarks/onebrc/data/
/benchmarks/onebrc/onebrc.cpp
/benchmarks/onebrc/*.exe
/benchmarks/onebrc/*.obj
/benchmarks/onebrc/*.pdb
